  "description": "Pick one Dataverse component (table, column, form, view, chart, workflow/flow, web resource, plugin step, security role, app, environment variable) and see its full \"where used\" footprint: the components it requires, the components that depend on it (from the platform dependency APIs), and a per-type usage tally. Emits a single change-safety verdict — Safe to change / Change with caution / High impact / Do not delete / Requires dependency review / Requires ALM review — with a banded impact score and a plain-language explanation of what would break and which review steps are required. Read-only; exports Excel/PDF/JSON/HTML.",
